{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/5986d48aa8fb084becd9ca7b08369f9a.poster.avif?t=1760434707\" width=616 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/5986d48aa8fb084becd9ca7b08369f9a.webm?t=1760434707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/5986d48aa8fb084becd9ca7b08369f9a.mp4?t=1760434707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fastest place to get the latest DODORI news! Come join us on DISCORD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/b46b11a31d647c1e0681ace74c428f77.avif?t=1760434707\" width=616 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DODORI is a rhythm adventure game where you perform music along the lines of a rotating square. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To create the ultimate performance, steady and passionate band practice is a must!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/d686e7315aef42fac296b8124e98275e.poster.avif?t=1760434707\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/d686e7315aef42fac296b8124e98275e.webm?t=1760434707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/d686e7315aef42fac296b8124e98275e.mp4?t=1760434707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/9332508aa7a0962d814a58b007179555.avif?t=1760434707\" width=616 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are only six days left until the festival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this year's festival feels different\u2014 Rumor has it a super famous band is coming to visit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But suddenly, your bandmates start handing in their resignation letters...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Sara, the vocalist of the Sowoon High School band, and it's up to you to bring the band back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/ddf9cae51ab9388bc3e50740b53a0d2e.poster.avif?t=1760434707\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/ddf9cae51ab9388bc3e50740b53a0d2e.webm?t=1760434707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/ddf9cae51ab9388bc3e50740b53a0d2e.mp4?t=1760434707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/8592f3976a0c4409d56ffc493d152885.avif?t=1760434707\" width=616 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DODORI isn\u2019t a serious game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, eating a gigantic pudding is a very important task that requires concentration, though! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many more diverse and cute events prepared, so don't miss out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/6f7f48ea4b881a4eeabe131e6c16a8c9.poster.avif?t=1760434707\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/6f7f48ea4b881a4eeabe131e6c16a8c9.webm?t=1760434707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/6f7f48ea4b881a4eeabe131e6c16a8c9.mp4?t=1760434707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>At the heart of this game is always music\u2014</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>but maybe, just maybe,</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>music isn't the most important thing after all.</i></strong>\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2903240?t=1760434707","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/2fa09a871b91202b56612ed1fa43c17fce2496a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760434707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/95aacd16bf37e0ab60913ec8e12fca7e9813c97a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760434707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/95aacd16bf37e0ab60913ec8e12fca7e9813c97a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760434707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3554970,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https