03240/extras/9332508aa7a0962d814a58b007179555.avif?t=1760434707\" width=616 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are only six days left until the festival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this year's festival feels different\u2014 Rumor has it a super famous band is coming to visit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But suddenly, your bandmates start handing in their resignation letters...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Sara, the vocalist of the Sowoon High School band, and it's up to you to bring the band back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/ddf9cae51ab9388bc3e50740b53a0d2e.poster.avif?t=1760434707\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/ddf9cae51ab9388bc3e50740b53a0d2e.webm?t=1760434707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/ddf9cae51ab9388bc3e50740b53a0d2e.mp4?t=1760434707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/8592f3976a0c4409d56ffc493d152885.avif?t=1760434707\" width=616 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DODORI isn\u2019t a serious game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, eating a gigantic pudding is a very important task that requires concentration, though! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many more diverse and cute events prepared, so don't miss out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/6f7f48ea4b8